From: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] irq: export irq_can_set_affinity to GPL modules

Wireless drivers built through backports are modules and need to query
whether an IRQ supports affinity before selecting threaded NAPI. Export the
existing helper so GPL modules can use it.

Signed-off-by: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>

---
 kernel/irq/manage.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/kernel/irq/manage.c
+++ b/kernel/irq/manage.c
@@ -160,6 +160,7 @@
 {
 	return __irq_can_set_affinity(irq_to_desc(irq));
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(irq_can_set_affinity);
 
 /**
  * irq_can_set_affinity_usr - Check if affinity of a irq can be set from user space
